	(descr "Samtec FTSH-105-01-L-DV-K surface mount micro header, 2x05, 1.27 mm pitch, double vertical (DV) formed tails, keying shroud, 3.05 mm mating posts; the ten pin ARM Cortex debug connector. Tails are 2.08 x 0.41 mm feet reaching 2.92 mm either side of centre, giving the 5.84 mm overall span in the series drawing; land is the generic 1.27 mm dual row SMD header pattern, which covers that foot with 0.10 mm heel, 0.23 mm toe and 0.16 mm side margins. Origin is the part centre; the shroud is asymmetric across the rows, reaching 2.545 mm on the pin 2 side and 1.965 mm on the pin 1 side")
